* text=auto
# PowerShell and batch files are stored byte-for-byte (UTF-8 BOM + CRLF) so Windows PowerShell 5.1 reads Greek text correctly.
*.ps1 -text
*.cmd -text

# The Gear World Hub files (sites/gwh) are kept byte-for-byte as they run live (mixed line ends included),
# so a deploy from here changes only what a change meant to change.
sites/gwh/** -text
